    # of the answer, printed so a failure says which half went wrong. They deliberately
    # recompute what `quoted_spans` does internally, and that is the point: when the two
    # agree and the haystack is still empty, the caller is what dropped the markers.
    probe_markers = markers_for(probe_path, probe_text)
